          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I Wear The Jewellery Daily?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! In fact, it is designed for it. Titanium is incredibly lightweight yet remarkably strong. You will barely feel it on your skin, making it the perfect, comfortable choice for everyday, all-day wear.</p>"
